    "en": {
      "title": "Casing handlers",
      "h1": "Casing handlers",
      "seoTitle": "Casing handlers HCC10X and HCC16X from TEI | Betongakuten",
      "description": "Hydraulic casing handlers from TEI that lift and place casing and drill pipe with the excavator, with no helper in the work zone. HCC10X and HCC16X.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "TEI Rock Drills logo",
          "href": "/produkter/tei",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1117,
          "src": "/assets/img/tei-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "A TEI casing handler is a hydraulic gripper that sits on the excavator arm and lifts, holds and places casing and drill pipe. Nobody has to stand in the danger zone holding the pipe by hand, and the pipe ends up straight and centred over the drill mast."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The handler attaches to the excavator stick and runs on the machine's auxiliary hydraulics, so the excavator does not need modifying. It grips casing and drill pipe at the same time and keeps them concentric. Two 360-degree positioners let the operator work in both vertical and horizontal planes, and a programmed controller gives smooth movement under load."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us</a> for price and more information."
        },
